              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose aramubwira ati “Dore ndava imbere yawe nsohoke, nsabe Uwiteka ngo amarumbo y'ibibugu ejo azave kuri Farawo no ku bagaragu be no ku bantu be. Ariko ye kongera kuriganya ntareke ubwoko bwacu bugenda bugatambira Uwiteka ibitambo.”",
          "type": "text",
